# --- Files the tools write at run time ---
# Frames and overlays saved by camera.py, basler_live.py, live_view.py, live_pick.py and
# the dashboard's "Save frame". The two sample frames below are kept on purpose
# (several tools use calibration_frame.png as their default input).
data/captured_frames/*
!data/captured_frames/calibration_frame.png
!data/captured_frames/overlay_live.png
# live_view.py mould teach (crops and values) - lab-specific, not part of the hand-in
data/mould/
data/mould.json
# teach_angle.py writes data/angle_teach.json through a temporary file; a crash can leave one
data/*.tmp
# calibrate.py writes this when it cannot find the marker
calib_fail.png
# template_fit.py default overlay
template_check.png
# verify_positions.py / verify_pos_code.py output
VisionCheck.mod
verify_out/
# dataset tools (prepare_dataset.py, optimized_anno_img.py) - large, not part of the repo
data/raw/
data/labels_obb/
data/dataset/
data/previews/
# training runs other than the shipped weights
runs/*
!runs/obb/
runs/obb/*
!runs/obb/obb_train/
runs/obb/obb_train/*
!runs/obb/obb_train/weights/
*.pt

# NOTE: these are needed and must stay tracked:
#   data/calibration.json, data/angle_teach.json,
#   runs/obb/obb_train/weights/best.onnx, runs/obb/obb_train/weights/best_ncnn_model/
